## Integrated IoT & AI-Powered Vertical Farming and Predictive Harvest Intelligence Platform

Act as a senior AgriTech product architect, UI/UX designer, frontend architect, full-stack engineer and AI/ML systems developer.

Your task is to develop **HARVESTIQ**, a premium, professional and functional digital platform for vertical farming intelligence.

The project must be developed with a clear long-term architecture, exceptional user experience, realistic functionality and a technically credible implementation strategy.

