Every design and implementation decision must support this central purpose:

**"Help vertical farmers understand how their crops are growing, when they are likely to mature, how much they may harvest and what requires attention."**

The platform should be simple for farmers, technically credible for developers and compelling to investors, industry partners and hackathon judges.

Build a polished product, not just a collection of screens.

